  "modifications": [
    "sps.hpp: max width 640 -> 800 for the captured CarPlay stream",
    "sps.hpp: max reference frames 16 -> 4; larger SPS is rejected to bound memory",
    "decoder.hpp: optional cooperative hook in the three macroblock loops; ESP32 yields every 100 MBs, host default is no-op",
    "0.1.5: optional exclusive timing scopes in CABAC bin engine, intra/inter prediction, inverse transforms and deblock; profile_hook.hpp defaults to no-op. Adapter samples every 32 VCL access units, excludes output callback, and includes measurement/scheduler overhead. No decoding arithmetic changes.",
    "0.1.6: bitstream.hpp keeps the same 8-byte read-ahead cache and zero-padding semantics; variable-width extraction and cached readBit use two uint32 halves instead of variable 64-bit shifts/masks. Valid n=0..32 and cache-crossing cases verified; decoding arithmetic unchanged."
  ],
